WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.737
The verdict.

00:00:01.687 --> 00:00:04.975
The housing crisis is not a market failure.

00:00:04.975 --> 00:00:07.262
It is a policy failure.

00:00:07.262 --> 00:00:13.350
The government created the conditions that made housing unaffordable for a generation of Canadians.
